Operations:
- trip.set_name: Name the trip.
- trip.set_travel_date: Set the day the traveler would rather fly.
- trip.add_extra: Add an extra to the trip.
- trip.open: Open a disruption case.
- trip.request_rebooking: Rebook the quoted flight.
- none: no operation listed does what is asked

